  "solution": {
    "idea": "<p>预处理阶乘 <code>fact[i] = i! mod p</code> 与阶乘逆元 <code>invfact[i]</code>：只对最大的那个 <code>fact[maxN]</code> 用一次费马小定理求幂 <code>pow(fact[maxN], p-2, p)</code>，再往前用 <code>invfact[i-1] = invfact[i] * i mod p</code> 倒推。询问就是 <code>fact[n] * invfact[k] * invfact[n-k] % p</code>，O(1)。</p><p>取模之后不能真的做除法：「除以一个数」要换成「乘它的逆元」，这是所有取模计数题的通用规矩。</p><p>核对：k 很小时用连乘、每一步带逆元的写法再算一次；n 不超过一千时直接拿 <code>math.comb</code> 算精确值再取余，三条路都得给同一个数。</p>",
    "code": "\"\"\"p62 组合数取模：T 组询问，每组给 n、k，输出 C(n, k) mod 1000000007，k 大于 n 时输出 0。\n预处理阶乘 fact[i] = i! mod p 和阶乘逆元 invfact[i] = (i!)^-1 mod p，\n一次询问 O(1)：C(n,k) = fact[n] * invfact[k] * invfact[n-k]。\ninvfact[maxN] 用费马小定理 pow(fact[maxN], p-2, p) 求出来，再倒推 invfact[i-1] = invfact[i]*i。\n核对：k 很小用连乘除逐个求逆元；n 不大直接用 math.comb 算精确值再取模。\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nimport math\n\nMOD = 1000000007\n\n\ndef prepare(max_n):\n    fact = [1] * (max_n + 1)\n    for i in range(1, max_n + 1):\n        fact[i] = fact[i - 1] * i % MOD\n    invfact = [1] * (max_n + 1)\n    invfact[max_n] = pow(fact[max_n], MOD - 2, MOD)     # 费马小定理\n    for i in range(max_n, 0, -1):\n        invfact[i - 1] = invfact[i] * i % MOD           # 倒推，少一次求幂\n    return fact, invfact\n\n\ndef comb_mod(n, k, fact, invfact):\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    return fact[n] * invfact[k] % MOD * invfact[n - k] % MOD\n\n\ndef comb_by_product(n, k):\n    \"\"\"C(n,k) = (n-k+1)*(n-k+2)*...*n / 1*2*...*k，每步用逆元代替除法。\"\"\"\n    k = min(k, n - k)\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, k + 1):\n        res = res * (n - k + i) % MOD * pow(i, MOD - 2, MOD) % MOD\n    return res\n\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    t = int(data[0])\n    qs = []\n    pos = 1\n    max_n = 0\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n, k = int(data[pos]), int(data[pos + 1])\n        pos += 2\n        qs.append((n, k))\n        if n > max_n:\n            max_n = n\n    fact, invfact = prepare(max_n)\n\n    out = []\n    for n, k in qs:\n        v = comb_mod(n, k, fact, invfact)\n        if 0 <= k <= n and min(k, n - k) <= 60:         # 连乘除法核对\n            assert v == comb_by_product(n, k), \"阶乘逆元与连乘除不一致\"\n        if 0 <= k <= n and n <= 1000:                   # 精确值核对\n            assert v == math.comb(n, k) % MOD, \"阶乘逆元与精确组合数不一致\"\n        out.append(str(v))\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out) + \"\\n\")\n\n\nmain()\n",
    "output": "$ python p62_comb_mod_query.py\n输入：3\n5 2\n10 3\n100000 0\n\n输出：10\r\n120\r\n1\r\n",
    "reference": "code/ch09-number-theory/11_mod_arithmetic.py"
  }
